A marker, not a record. A file named interface-craft-record.md.removed in a
demonstration's root takes the record out of the composition instead of
inheriting base's, which is the only way to commit a tree whose design record is
genuinely ABSENT.

C1 asks a repo to commit a record. A check that treated an absent one as an
empty one would report "no exception is claimed" and pass, which is the shape of
a gate that grades nothing.
